Package: ggvolc
Type: Package
Title: Create Volcano Plots for Differential Gene Expression Data
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Loukas", "Theodosiou",
    email = "theodosiou@evolbio.mpg.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6418-4652"))
Description: Creates customizable volcano plots for differential gene
    expression results from RNA-seq analyses. Accepts result objects or tables
    from 'DESeq2', 'edgeR', and 'limma' directly, with automatic column
    detection. Labels the most significant or chosen genes, colors gene sets,
    compares several contrasts side by side, offers colorblind-safe color
    presets, and can produce interactive plots with 'ggiraph'. Gene tables are
    rendered with 'gt' and composed with 'patchwork'.
